{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106100","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910610001:1":{"text":"ん？なんか拾ったのか？","source_cn":"怎么，捡到啥了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C4468CA4283F230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910610002:1":{"text":"これは……ほら貝？タラサでかなり昔に使われてた潮笛貝（しおぶえがい）に似てる。模様までそっくりだよ。","source_cn":"这是……螺号？它看起来很像塔拉萨很早之前用的“潮音螺”...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB6656AF64073217","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910610003:1":{"text":"巻貝小屋で音を出せるようになるまでは、みんなこのほら貝で潮の合図を送り合ってたんだ。吹くと、海流が珊瑚のほら穴を通り抜けるような音がするんだよ。","source_cn":"在螺屋被改造得能发声之前，各个家族之间都用这种螺号传递...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CD634B7FE7DD6A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910610004:1":{"text":"うちのはとっくにどこへ行ったか分からないけど、これはどこも壊れてないみたい。ハダルたちも、こういうので連絡を取り合ってたのかな？","source_cn":"我们家那只早就不知道丢到哪里去了，但沉在海床里的这只还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C64AF0814879A7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910610005:1":{"text":"エフィラがほら貝を吹き鳴らすと、「ブオーー」という振動が波紋のように広がった。","source_cn":"艾菲拉吹响螺号，“呜呜”的震动一圈圈荡漾开。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7615028F4F3A6138","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"エフィラがほら貝を吹き鳴らすと、「ブオーー」という振動が波紋のように広がった。","female":"エフィラがほら貝を吹き鳴らすと、「ブオーー」という振動が波紋のように広がった。","variant_male_record_index":"253029","variant_female_record_index":"253030","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910610006:1":{"text":"音も同じだ。やっぱり、あたしたちって似てるところもあるんだね……","source_cn":"一样的声音。原来他们和我们有些地方是一样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF54CCDD1E151A6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:图澜":{"text":"オットー","source":"图澜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:艾菲拉":{"text":"エフィラ","source":"艾菲拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}